OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 20 years for murder
OL,4,Aof pregnant mother-of-two
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who beat pregnant mother-of-two
OL,7,FSarah Montgomery to death has been
OL,8,Fjailed for a minimum of 20 years for
OL,9,Fmurder and child destruction.
OL,11,FSarah Montgomery, 27, was 32 weeks
OL,12,Fpregnant when she was murdered by her
OL,13,Fon-off partner Zak Hughes in her flat
OL,14,Fin Donaghadee, County Down, in June
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FHe was the father of Sarah's two
OL,18,Fchildren, girls aged five and seven,
OL,19,Fand the unborn baby boy who died in the
OL,20,Fattack.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
