OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 20 years for murder
OL,4,Aof pregnant mother-of-two
OL,5,
OL,6,FHughes, 29, from Ardglen Place in
OL,7,FArdoyne, Belfast, pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fboth charges in June 2026. The judge
OL,9,Ftold Hughes he was guilty of the
OL,10,F"brutal, completely unjustified murder
OL,11,Fof a defenceless, heavily pregnant
OL,12,Fmother".
